            The best chest freezer is the one sized to the food you will actually keep and rated for the room it will live in. For a family with a garage, that is the GE 7.0 Cu. Ft. Garage Ready Chest Freezer, with the Insignia 5.0 Garage Ready as the budget alternative. Indoors, the Midea 7.0 Convertible adds flexibility, the Frigidaire 5.0 is the safe middle choice, and the Midea 3.5 is the apartment-size pick.
